<section class="page-shell"><div class="page-card"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>AutoPartFlow stores account, customer, order, delivery, and authentication information required to operate the ERP customer portal.</p><h2>Information Used</h2><p>Registration may store name, username, email, phone number, and password hash. Orders store delivery and transaction details needed to process and track an order.</p><h2>Access</h2><p>Signed-in customers can access their own order information. Guest tracking requires the order number and the phone number associated with the order.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>The application uses server-side validation, prepared SQL statements, session authentication, and CSRF protection for customer order submission.</p></div></section>
